    "Component descriptions: The following components have usage descriptions or documentation links defined in Figma. These descriptions provide important context about the intended usage, best practices, and any constraints for each component. Follow these guidelines when implementing or using these components.\n\n## Analytify/Route glows\n**Node ID:** 529:21518\n\nRoute glows animate between destination layouts independently of the persistent particle loop. On first document render, establish the destination immediately without a document view transition from an empty page. Animate subsequent in-app destination changes; preserve the independent particle loop and reduced-motion treatment.\n\n## Analytify/Ambient background\n**Node ID:** 266:18224\n\nLarge green and blue glows are fixed within a page, including during scrolling. Glow positions change only on page navigation, with a smooth route transition. Particle phases loop continuously over 24 seconds; all phases within one Scene have identical glow positions, size and opacity. Shared backdrop behind opaque cards and navigation. Mobile uses fewer and softer dots. Still variant provides reduced motion. Implementation must preserve one shell-level background: scroll can move dots but must never modify glow coordinates.\n\n## Size=Expanded\n**Node ID:** 62:2590\n\nShared desktop navigation rail with a softly rounded inset surface and gentle shadow. Visual surface is independent of layout: icon and section-label center remains X=33 in both expanded and collapsed modes; logo center remains Y=24, matching the top bar. Logo still toggles expansion. Profile stays at the bottom.\n\n## Analytify/Icon / list\n**Node ID:** 58:2106\n\nPrimeIcons list from the implemented mobile navigation.\n\n## Analytify/Icon / chart-bar\n**Node ID:** 58:2114\n\nPrimeIcons chart-bar from the implemented mobile navigation.\n\n## Analytify/Icon / history\n**Node ID:** 58:2119\n\nPrimeIcons history from the implemented mobile navigation.\n\n## Analytify/Icon / user\n**Node ID:** 62:2389\n\nPrimeIcons user from the app icon library.\n\n## Analytify/Icon / star\n**Node ID:** 62:2346\n\nPrimeIcons star from the app icon library.\n\n## Analytify/Icon / share-alt\n**Node ID:** 62:2357\n\nPrimeIcons share-alt from the app icon library.\n\n## Analytify/Icon / clone\n**Node ID:** 62:2350\n\nPrimeIcons clone from the app icon library.\n\n## Analytify/Page heading\n**Node ID:** 139:7724\n\nShared identity region for every full page. Desktop: Display heading, Body description, 8 px gap. Mobile: Heading title, optional description, 8 px gap. Primary actions may sit beside this component on desktop or in the content toolbar on mobile. Page padding is 32 px desktop / 16 px mobile; the following content starts 16 px / 12 px after the header. Do not add per-page offsets or headings above this component.\n\n## Viewport=Desktop, State=Active\n**Node ID:** 218:11650\n\nPlaylist section tab. Mobile icon above existing label; desktop icon beside label. Green active border and fill.\n\n## Analytify/Section tab\n**Node ID:** 218:11685\n\nShared section navigation. Consistent bordered tabs with semantic icons, selected state and native prototype actions. Desktop horizontal; compact mobile icon above label.\n\n## Viewport=Desktop, State=Inactive\n**Node ID:** 218:11645\n\nPlaylist section tab. Mobile icon above existing label; desktop icon beside label. Green active border and fill.\n\n## Analytify/Icon / bell\n**Node ID:** 62:2367\n\nPrimeIcons bell from the app icon library.\n\n## Analytify/Icon / sync\n**Node ID:** 62:2363\n\nPrimeIcons sync from the app icon library.\n\n## Analytify/Icon / database\n**Node ID:** 222:11680\n\nSemantic database icon paired with an existing link or section name.\n\n## State=Default\n**Node ID:** 227:11961\n\nNavigation row. Icon identifies the destination; right chevron means open that page. Full row click target. Existing label wraps instead of clipping.\n\n## Analytify/Icon / link\n**Node ID:** 227:11774\n\nSemantic link icon. Pair with an existing accessible control label. Color inherits action role.\n\n## Analytify/Icon / chevron-right\n**Node ID:** 62:2392\n\nPrimeIcons chevron-right from the app icon library.\n\n## Analytify/Icon / shield\n**Node ID:** 222:11668\n\nSemantic shield icon paired with an existing link or section name.\n\n## Analytify/danger\n**Node ID:** 24:112\n\nShared danger control. 48 px targets. Keyboard focus remains visible. Disabled only while unavailable or submitting; explain the reason nearby.\n\n## Analytify/Icon / sign-out\n**Node ID:** 62:2376\n\nPrimeIcons sign-out from the app icon library.\n\n## Analytify/Footer\n**Node ID:** 25:24\n\nSpotify attribution and legal/privacy link shared by every route.\n\n## Analytify/tertiary\n**Node ID:** 24:103\n\nShared tertiary control. 48 px targets. Keyboard focus remains visible. Disabled only while unavailable or submitting; explain the reason nearby.",
